From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CEB-GNRD board layer <bmc@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] strings: add the CEB-GNR-D product name

"ipmitool mc info" prints the Product Name from a built-in table; add the
CEB-GNR-D entry (manufacturer 6659 = 0x1A03, product 3346 = 0x0D12).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD board-specific product id]
---
 lib/ipmi_strings.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)
diff --git a/lib/ipmi_strings.c b/lib/ipmi_strings.c
--- a/lib/ipmi_strings.c
+++ b/lib/ipmi_strings.c
@@ -77,6 +77,9 @@
 } oem_valstr_list_t;
 
 const struct oemvalstr ipmi_oem_product_info[] = {
+   /* CEB-GNRD board: manufacturer 6659 (0x1A03), product 3346 (0x0D12) */
+   { 6659, 3346, "CEB-GNR-D" },
+
    /* Keep OEM grouped together */
 
    /* For ipmitool debugging */
